0af38d44261fc9af67deb9998f5e.mp4?t=1781155276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Accomplish Nobunaga Oda's unrealized ambition to unify Japan!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336980/extras/053ffff7c95f8129f3e99236ff16aaee.poster.avif?t=1781155276\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336980/extras/053ffff7c95f8129f3e99236ff16aaee.webm?t=1781155276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336980/extras/053ffff7c95f8129f3e99236ff16aaee.mp4?t=1781155276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Players are supported by faithful retainers who act on their own judgement. The &quot;Dominion&quot; system will allow you to obtain and grant territory to retainers. In return, retainers who are given the land will dedicate themselves to the development of the clan. Divvy up and parcel out the beautifully detailed Warring States Japan as you like, and make it prosper!<br>Over 2,200 officers will be included, the greatest number in the series. Come together with highly individualistic retainers and move history!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336980/extras/0c84c4e30a3c9bf9a701043347df3ae2.poster.avif?t=1781155276\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336980/extras/0c84c4e30a3c9bf9a701043347df3ae2.webm?t=1781155276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336980/extras/0c84c4e30a3c9bf9a701043347df3ae2.mp4?t=1781155276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted 